# Large media — exceeds GitHub's 100MB per-file limit
CV Video.mp4
*.mp4
# No .mp4 is a production asset any more: the footer is a still image
# (public/footer.webp). Reference clips live in assets-source/, outside
# public/, so nothing video-sized is ever copied into dist.

# Originals and retired media (~107MB). Kept on disk so nothing is
# unrecoverable, but outside public/ so it never reaches dist, and
# untracked so it never reaches GitHub.
assets-source/
